<section class="fade-in">
  <h2>Detailed Programme</h2>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="panel-head">Rangkaian kegiatan Brilliant Competition XVIII</div>
    <div class="panel-body">

      <div class="prog-day">
        <div class="prog-head"><span class="prog-num">TAHAP 1</span> Pendaftaran <em>24 Agu – 25 Sep · Online</em></div>
        <ul class="prog-list">
          <li><span class="prog-time">24–31 Agu</span><div><strong>Early Registration</strong><p>Rp 175.000 per tim</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">1–25 Sep</span><div><strong>Regular Registration</strong><p>Rp 200.000 per tim</p></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prog-day">
        <div class="prog-head"><span class="prog-num">TAHAP 2</span> Penyisihan 1 <em>24–30 September · Online</em></div>
        <ul class="prog-list">
          <li><span class="prog-time">24 Sep 15:00</span><div><strong>Soal dibuka</strong><p>Dikirim ke email peserta terdaftar</p></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">30 Sep 18:00</span><div><strong>Batas pengumpulan</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">6 Okt 15:00</span><div><strong>Pengumuman Lolos P2</strong><p>Diumumkan secara online</p></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prog-day">
        <div class="prog-head"><span class="prog-num">TAHAP 3</span> Technical Meeting <em>10 Oktober · Online</em></div>
        <ul class="prog-list">
          <li><span class="prog-time">14:00–17:00</span><div><strong>Briefing, Technical Meeting &amp; Live Class</strong><p>Live class membahas soal BComp tahun sebelumnya sebagai persiapan babak berikutnya</p></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prog-day">
        <div class="prog-head"><span class="prog-num">TAHAP 4</span> Kedatangan <em>14 Oktober · PLC</em></div>
        <ul class="prog-list">
          <li><span class="prog-time">14:00–19:00</span><div><strong>Kedatangan &amp; check-in PLC</strong><p>Penabur Learning Center, bagi peserta yang menginap</p></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prog-day">
        <div class="prog-head"><span class="prog-num">TAHAP 5</span> Penyisihan 2 &amp; Semifinal <em>15 Oktober · SMAK PENABUR GS</em></div>
        <ul class="prog-list">
          <li><span class="prog-time">07:00–08:00</span><div><strong>Registrasi Ulang</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">08:00–09:10</span><div><strong>Pembukaan BCOMP XVIII</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">09:10–09:45</span><div><strong>Persiapan Penyisihan 2</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">09:45–10:00</span><div><strong>Briefing P2</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">10:00–12:00</span><div><strong>Babak Penyisihan 2</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">12:00–13:30</span><div><strong>Istirahat</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">13:40–14:25</span><div><strong>Pengumuman P2</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">14:25–15:00</span><div><strong>Persiapan Semifinal</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">15:00–17:30</span><div><strong>Semifinal</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">21:00</span><div><strong>Pengumuman Lolos Final</strong><p>Diumumkan secara online</p></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prog-day">
        <div class="prog-head"><span class="prog-num">TAHAP 6</span> Final &amp; Penutupan <em>16 Oktober · SMAK PENABUR GS</em></div>
        <ul class="prog-list">
          <li><span class="prog-time">06:30–07:00</span><div><strong>Daftar Ulang</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">07:00–07:30</span><div><strong>Technical Meeting Final</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">07:30–11:30</span><div><strong>Babak Final</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">11:30–13:00</span><div><strong>Makan Siang</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">13:00–14:30</span><div><strong>Workshop</strong></div></li>
          <li><span class="prog-time">14:30–16:00</span><div><strong>Penutupan &amp; Penyerahan Hadiah</strong></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="note">Jadwal dapat berubah sewaktu-waktu dan akan disampaikan melalui situs resmi Brilliant Competition.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

